      "comment": "DOONGALLA MIMIC (3) missed the frame latest when seventh at The Meadows (31.01) but was a winner five back in the second best time of the program. Has ability and can bounce back. AUSTRAL WARRIORS (7) used the inside draw to advantage last time and hit the ground running with a fast early split, but could manage only the minor money when a 0.8 lengths second at Sale over 510m in 29.20. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. IMPACTING (8) steps out for the first time at this circuit. Comes here a last start placegetter at Warragul in a Free For All (26.09). Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. KRAKEN REG (2) will give backers a sight.",
